    "stem": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The Galápagos is a group of islands with a high biodiversity.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 12
        }
      }
    ],
    "parts": [
      {
        "key": "a",
        "label": "(a)",
        "source": {
          "qp": 12
        },
        "stem": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<i>Geospiza</i> <i>fortis</i> is one of the many species of finch that live on the Galápagos islands. On one of the Galápagos islands, Daphne Major, scientists measured the bill size (length, width and depth) of individuals in a population of <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> over several years.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fig. 5.1 shows a <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> female.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "figure",
            "id": "fig5.1",
            "caption": "Fig. 5.1",
            "src": "figures/q5_fig5_1.png",
            "alt": "Galápagos finch",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> feed on seeds. Seed size and bill size vary. It is easier for <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> with smaller bills to eat small seeds and for <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> with larger bills to eat large seeds.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In 1977, a drought occurred on Daphne Major, which resulted in a large decrease in the availability of seeds, particularly small seeds.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Scientists observed an increase in the mean bill size in the <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> population on Daphne Major after the drought.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "parts": [
          {
            "key": "a.i",
            "label": "(i)",
            "source": {
              "qp": 12,
              "ms": 13
            },
            "stem": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "State the type of natural selection that occurred in the <i>G.</i> <i>fortis</i> population on Daphne Major as a result of the drought.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 12
                }
              }
            ],
            "marks": 1,
            "topics": [
              {
                "ref": "17.2(2)",
                "role": "primary"
              }
            ],
            "markScheme": {
              "marks": 1,
