              "qp": 14,
              "ms": 13
            },
            "stem": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The scientists carried out a Pearson’s linear correlation calculation for the data in Fig. 5.4.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The scientists calculated an <b><i>r</i></b> value of 0.930.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The scientists concluded that there is a significant correlation between the number of tourists visiting the Galápagos islands each year and the number of invasive alien species present.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 14
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Table 5.1 shows a probability table of critical values for Pearson’s linear correlation.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 15
                }
              },
              {
