                    "0.875"
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With reference to Table 5.1, explain why the <b><i>r</i></b> value of 0.930 indicates that there is a significant correlation between the number of tourists and the number of invasive alien species.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 15
                }
              }
